  "prefLabel": "Plu 212.05 Closing the Record",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plu 212.05 Closing the Record. After the conclusion of the hearing and the filing of such post-hearing submissions as may be ordered by the presiding officer, the record shall be closed and no additional evidence shall be received into the record except as allowed by Plu 211.06.\n\nSource. #8464, eff 10-28-05",
